\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs20\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid5318829\charrsid4668804 W}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4406103 elcome to beta 10}{
\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid1791332\charrsid4668804  Endless Ages Beta}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2970920\charrsid4668804 
\par 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10582561\charrsid4668804 Getting started quickly
\par -To play run endlessage.exe}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2970920\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10582561\charrsid4668804 -Click the connect to server button
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid16346449\charrsid4668804 -let any incoming patches fully download
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10582561\charrsid4668804 -When it connects select the server of your choice}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2970920\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4406103 Beta }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid292065\charrsid4668804 instructions
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10098362\charrsid4668804 -log in to the login screen with your username and password-then click on enter
\par 
\par Creating a new character
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9195036\charrsid4668804 -Click on \'93Create N}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10098362\charrsid4668804 ew}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9195036\charrsid4668804  Character\'94
\par -Select race by clicking on Next Race or Prev Race}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10098362\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9195036\charrsid4668804 -}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid7153730\charrsid4668804 Change and customize your character the way you would like.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9195036\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid7153730\charrsid4668804 -Fill in the name field
\par -Accept
\par -The you will be taken back to character selection screen
\par -Select character then click on select and play
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid1454079\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid3154596\charrsid4668804 Skills \endash  there are }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid13777432 eleven}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid3154596\charrsid4668804  skills in this beta}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid15096584\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9073840\charrsid4668804 Remember all races can learn any skill but beware too many skills spread out will result in very slow learning, and some races learn a lot faster than others.
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid3154596\charrsid4668804 
\par 1) Shape Shifting-
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11666666\charrsid4668804 This skill requires shape Shift Orbs to attempt the skill. This skill you will adapt all the advantages of the creatures that you shift to.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid1791332\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11666666\charrsid4668804 Humans and Amphibious learn this skill at a reasonable rate.
\par 
\par 2) Hiding
\par This skill you can completely disappear from any monster or player, it is a very powerful skill but slow to perfect}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid267021\charrsid4668804 , you begin learning this skill by binding the hide to a specified ke
y. The binds can be accessed through the controls menu.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11666666\charrsid4668804 
\par Amphibious will learn this the fastest.
\par 
\par 3)}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid267021\charrsid4668804  Engineering}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12810322\charrsid4668804  }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11666666\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9634294\charrsid4668804 This skill requires engineering kits, each kit can access different abilities to create weapons or items that have moving parts.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12810322\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9634294\charrsid4668804 Human will master}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2373668\charrsid4668804  }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9634294\charrsid4668804  this skill the fastest.
\par 
\par 4)}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2373668\charrsid4668804  Smithy}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid9634294\charrsid4668804 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2373668 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2373668\charrsid4668804 This skill requires }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid6436919\charrsid4668804 smithy}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2373668\charrsid4668804 
 kits, each kit can access different abilities to }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid6436919\charrsid4668804 forge}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2373668\charrsid4668804  weapons or }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8269065\charrsid4668804 amour}{
\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2373668\charrsid4668804 .
\par Human will master  this skill the fastest. 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid204058\charrsid4668804 
\par 5) Weapon Tech
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8269065\charrsid4668804 Guns / Artillery  use
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2106300\charrsid4668804 Bloblic will master }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8413895\charrsid4668804  }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid2106300\charrsid4668804 this the fastest
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid204058\charrsid4668804 
\par 6) Mind Control
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10911718\charrsid4668804 Used by amphibious race to control animals and use them as weapons and items
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8413895\charrsid4668804 Amphibious
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid204058\charrsid4668804 
\par 7) Alchemy/Bar tending
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10911718\charrsid4668804 Create drinks, smoothies, beer, health potions or firebombs
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8413895\charrsid4668804 Humans will master  this the fastest
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid204058\charrsid4668804 
\par 8) Melee
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10911718\charrsid4668804 Use of swords or hand weapons
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8090710 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8090710\charrsid4668804 Bloblic will master  this the fastest
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2373668 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8090710 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4653284 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4653284 9) Familiar}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4653284\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4653284 Book of Familiars is the tool of a friend of familiars, all races can do this if they can find the scrolls and the book that is required. With this skill you can ride a wide variety animals.
\par 
\par 10) Reveal
\par You can detect hidden people as well as items. Bloblic master this the fastest.
\par 
\par 11) Piloting
\par This skill will allow you to access vehicles of different types. The routes of accomplishing this skill is different for each race.
\par 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4653284\charrsid4668804 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2373668 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4653284\charrsid4668804 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid1791332\charrsid4668804 
\par 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 Default Controls}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 
\par E }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804                     }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804   Forward}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 S                       Strafe Left
\par F                       Strafe Right
\par D                      Backwards
\par G                      Jet Pack
\par T                      Talk/Chat
\par Q                      First Person Camera View
\par Z                      Third Person Camera View
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid12669557 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 Space-              Jump
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 Mouse 1           Fire
\par F8-                   }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid16346449\charrsid4668804 Examine/Action-you can loot bodies and interact with AI with this action and examine things in the world.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 F5-                   }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 Inventory
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 Ctrl Q              }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 Quit Game
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12389252\charrsid4668804 F1                    Main Menu (quit game, controls, resolution)
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid16449599\charrsid4668804 X                     Group Chat- talk with anyone that\rquote s in your group list anywhere in the world.
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid7764875\charrsid4668804 
\par Note: you can assign actions/emotes to any key in the CONTROLS menu.
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 
\par Typed Commands}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid16449599\charrsid4668804  (in normal chat window)}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid15151905\charrsid4668804  Most of these function can be used from the Commands menu as well.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 

\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid16739555\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid89708\charrsid4668804 :BUY                        }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                         }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid89708\charrsid4668804  opens purchasing menu in store
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid7616899\charrsid4668804 :}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 BANK                   }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                         }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804  }{
\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804  }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804   opens bank in bank zones}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804  (withdrawal and deposit can be accessed through bank.}{
\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid7616899\charrsid4668804 :}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 WITHDRAWAL     }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                           }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 
 type command in withdrawal then space and the amount
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 :DEPOSIT                }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                         }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804  deposits the amount from inventory to account
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid7616899\charrsid4668804 :}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 LOOT                       }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                         }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 loots quest
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid5595175\charrsid4668804 :TRADE                  }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                         }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid5595175\charrsid4668804   initiates trade with close character
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804 :REBIRTH              }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                          }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12669557\charrsid4668804   reposition respawning point (must be is a safe zone)}{
\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10307671\charrsid4668804  }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid3566727\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10307671\charrsid4668804 :SQUELCH              }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                         }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10307671\charrsid4668804  blocks the speech of a player  (example-  :SQUELCH BOBBY
\par :}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid8215104\charrsid4668804 DE}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10307671\charrsid4668804 SQUELCH        }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804                          }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10307671\charrsid4668804 
 unblocks the messages from a player}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid10307671 
\par }{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804 :CREATECLAN clan prefix              Creates a clan if you are not currently in one.\line :REQUESTJOIN clan prefix             Sends a request to guild master of the clan you specified}{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 
\line :APPROVERECRUIT playername}{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804    If you are a clan leader this is how you accept members that request to join.}{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 \line :VIEWROSTER}{\f1\fs16\insrsid6424245 
                                if you are part of a clan you can request the roster with this command}{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 \line :DISBANCLAN}{\f1\fs16\insrsid6424245                         
         members this will just remove you from the clan, clan masters this will delete the clan.}{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 \line }{\f1\fs16\insrsid6424245 
:REMOVEMEMBER playername     clan leaders only, this will remove a member. Specify the name without prefix.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid3566727\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid16346449\charrsid4668804 Quests are given out by many NPCs also there will be GM Held events.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid16449599\charrsid4668804  Use the examine-action to talk with NPCs.}{
\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid5783284\charrsid4668804 
\par   }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11197\charrsid4668804 
\par COMMANDS LIST:
\par To Access commands hit F1
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid5783284\charrsid4668804    
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid137028\charrsid4668804 GROUPS:
\par To invite someone into your group get close to him and use the GROUPS command from the command menu.  Select the person you wish to invite from the left list, then click INVITE. If he agrees you will be notified that this person has joined your group. In 
the event that you do not wish to have this person in your group, use the GROUPS command, select the person in the right list and REMOVE him. To talk with people in your group use GROUP CHAT  default is X.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11696365\charrsid4668804 

\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid13511900 HOUSING:
\par Housing works by land availability and you need a house placement letter. You use the letter In the world and your house will appear. Housing space is limited and only allowed in some areas, but we will continue to add housing zones so don\rquote t worry.

\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid13511900\charrsid4668804 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid11197\charrsid4668804 EMOTES:
\par There is no default for them, you must go to controls and select the action ie. DANCE1, SALUTE etc and bind it to a key of your choice. The control configuration menu can be accessed by using CONTROLS command in the commands list. 
\par }{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid13132979\charrsid4668804 
\par SAFE ZONES:
\par You are safe from other players in safe zones, no one but you can loot your body}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid12064997\charrsid4668804  and you cannot take damage from another player in them.}{\f1\fs16\cgrid0\insrsid13132979 
\par }{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 \line 1) 7 murders you will be considered a murderer. And your name will glow Red. Safe zones will no longer protect you. But will continue to protect the non murderers even if 
they attack you. Basically you are an outcast at this point.\line 2) You will be able to defend your self without taking a murder\line 3) if three people kill a player all three will get a murder count\line 
4) if you are on the same clan you will not gain a murder count from killing your own clan members.\line 5) Black market is not in yet(Beta 10, April 15)so as a murderer you will have no home. \line 
6) If you are attacked and a monster ends up making the final blow, the person will still get the murder if his attack was under 3 min ago.\line 7)The life of a }{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804 murderer will be difficult. \line 8)B}{
\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 ounty systems/other featu}{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804 res will be on the way.\line 9)P}{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804\charrsid4668804 eople can kill murderers all }{\f1\fs16\insrsid4668804 day without getting a murder.}{
